{"version":1,"content":"<p>現在熱播的台慶劇《玫瑰戰爭》，昨晚（11日）一集陳星妤飾演的「寶兒」穿上短裙Look首度登場，更與視后楊茜堯及視帝馬國明上演多場精彩對手戲，甫登場已引關注。</p><p>劇中陳星妤其實是陳自瑤的親生女兒，今次因照顧昔日家中的老工人而暫時返回香港，當中一幕</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T06:23:50.697076+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T05:04:35+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T06:17:14.146780+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T06:17:14.146780+00:00","content_hash":"e6d885f2aa839c9d007c232fcd701606bd3dbfc411fd687f0b2e50ffbcd04349","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}